#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:2
#: 5c524c4b87ee431fbec8ddd40a025b87
msgid "Build with Conan"
msgstr "使用 Conan 构建"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:4
#: 35ad52996ce94e9b9b6cf7594a2b459b
msgid ""
"The package recipe in ``conanfile.py`` reads its requirements from "
"``conandata.yml``. PCL, Eigen, and nlohmann_json are runtime requirements; "
"pybind11 is included when Python bindings are enabled. GTest is used by the "
"test package, not by the runtime library."
msgstr ""
"``conanfile.py`` 配方从 ``conandata.yml`` 读取依赖。PCL、Eigen 和 nlohmann_json "
"是运行时依赖；启用 Python 绑定时还会引入 pybind11。GTest 只供测试包使用，不属于运行时库。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:9
#: 4e10cefc0d684bc3af57819251d226aa
msgid "Build and run the consumer check"
msgstr "构建并运行使用方检查"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:11
#: 8c148d9d6ac442b489ab7241e11168ab
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录执行："

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:17
#: 2c84a6f1f943407c89efa5a335a3454b
msgid ""
"``conan create`` builds the package and runs the test package's consumer "
"executable. The full CTest suite runs only when ``trigger_tests`` is enabled"
" in ``metadata.json``. ``--build=missing`` permits Conan to build a "
"dependency from source when it cannot find a compatible binary. PCL can take"
" a long time on the first run for that reason. A package in the cache is "
"reusable only when its version, options, compiler settings, and dependency "
"graph match the requested profile."
msgstr ""
"``conan create`` 构建库，并运行测试包里的使用方可执行程序。只有 ``metadata.json`` 中的 "
"``trigger_tests`` 为 true 时，才会运行完整的 CTest 测试集。``--build=missing`` 允许 Conan "
"在找不到兼容二进制时从源码编译依赖，因此首次执行可能花较长时间编译 PCL。缓存中的包只有在版本、选项、编译器设置和依赖图与当前 profile "
"匹配时才能复用。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:24
#: bb4f277616804a3181a80ff33c9f9766
msgid ""
"To avoid a local PCL source build, use a remote with a matching prebuilt PCL"
" package or add one to the local cache before creating this package. "
"Removing ``--build=missing`` instead makes Conan fail when the binary is "
"absent; it does not provide that binary. Check the resolved Conan profile "
"and the PCL package ID when a build is unexpectedly repeated."
msgstr ""
"若想避免本机编译 PCL，需要从远端获取匹配的预编译包，或先把匹配包加入本地缓存。删除 ``--build=missing`` 只会在缺少二进制包时使 "
"Conan 报错，并不会产生二进制包。若每次都重新编译，应核对实际解析出的 Conan profile 和 PCL package ID。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:30
#: f2588406cc884b76a6d9ccf1c8e237be
msgid "How the recipe reaches CMake"
msgstr "配方如何调用 CMake"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:32
#: fc12ba03d17045d4b947d9c14389aa59
msgid ""
"The recipe creates a CMake toolchain and dependency files, then passes the C"
" and C++ target lists to ``CMakeLists.txt``. The C++ library links PCL, "
"Eigen, and nlohmann_json. The public headers and exported CMake targets are "
"installed with the package. Python bindings are built on the host when "
"``enable_python_bindings`` is true in ``metadata.json``; cross builds skip "
"the host Python module."
msgstr ""
"配方生成 CMake toolchain 和依赖文件，并将 C/C++ 目标列表传给 ``CMakeLists.txt``。C++ 库链接 "
"PCL、Eigen 和 nlohmann_json。公开头文件及导出的 CMake 目标随包安装。``metadata.json`` 中的 "
"``enable_python_bindings`` 为 true 时，主机构建会生成 Python 绑定；交叉构建跳过主机 Python 模块。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/conan.rst:38
#: 88314de83ea440fd8b731686ef16251d
msgid ""
"For a bare-metal profile, the recipe filters dependencies through "
"``baremetal_white_list``. The PCL measurement path is unavailable there and "
"returns ``kUnsupportedPlatform``. The cross-build archive check verifies "
"target ISA attributes; it does not make the host measurement algorithm "
"available on the board."
msgstr ""
"裸机 profile 下，配方只保留 ``baremetal_white_list`` 中的依赖。基于 PCL 的测量流程在裸机端不可用，返回 "
"``kUnsupportedPlatform``。交叉构建的归档检查验证目标 ISA 属性，但不会让主机测量算法在板上运行。"
